label sh_ch38:
    label .s1:

        $ set_window_tint(TINT_HANAKO)

        call sisterhood_timeskip

        scene bg school_gate_ss
        show hisao basic_smile_uni_close_ss at twoleft
        with charaenter

        play music music_pearly fadein 4.0

        "The sun is already setting by the time Hisao and I make our way to the parking lot. I received a text message from Lilly's mother telling me that they landed safely and that she'll drop Lilly off near the school gates."
        hi "Are you sure they'll be here soon?"
        ha "Yes. It should take them less than an hour to get here."

        show hisao basic_grin_uni_close_ss
        with chchange

        "My boyfriend chuckles a bit."
        hi "I have this strange feeling of déjà vu. Don't you?"
        "I smile and nod back."
        ha "Yes. This is exactly the same situation as when we were waiting here for Lilly before."

        show hisao cross_pout_uni_close_ss
        with chchange

        hi "Well, it's not exactly the same."
        "That's true. The last time we were here waiting for Lilly to arrive, Hisao was wondering out loud whether we should be holding hands or not. This time, we've been holding hands since we got here."

        stop music fadeout 2.0

        show misha cross_smile_ss at right
        show shizu adjust_happy_ss at tworight
        with charaenter

        queue music music_shizune fadein 4.0

        "He probably would have wrapped his arm around me too if it wasn't for the other thing that's different from before: the presence of the other two Yamaku students who invited themselves onto our welcoming committee."
        ha "No, not exactly the same."
        "Hisao throws a suspicious side-glance at our classmates."
        hi "It's kind of heartwarming to see that you've missed Lilly so much that you're joining us here to welcome her back."

        show shizu adjust_smug_ss
        show misha cross_grin_ss
        with chchange

        mi "Hicchan, ever since we came here with you, you've done nothing but gripe. If I didn't know better, I'd say our presence here is bothering you. If we're imposing on you, you should just come out and say so."

        show hisao cross_worry_uni_close_ss
        with chchange

        hi "You're not really imposing, but..."
        mi "Perhaps you were hoping to take the opportunity to be lovey-dovey with your girlfriend for a little while, and us being here is preventing you from doing that."

        show misha cross_laugh_ss
        with chchange

        mi "WAHAHAHAHA~!"

        show hisao cross_frown_uni_close_ss
        with chchange

        hi "That's not really the issue here."

        nvl clear
        nvl show dissolve

        n "It looks like Hisao has been thinking the same thing as I have."
        n "{vspace=60}When Lilly's mother and Akira left for the US, Lilly decided to stay in Scotland to look after her father, and as a result, she wasn't able to return to Yamaku until the company's business delegation was back from their trip."
        n "Because of that, Lilly has missed close to 2 weeks of school, and during those weeks, Shizune has missed no opportunity to express her disapproval of her cousin's absence."
        n "{vspace=30}When Hisao and I went for the gate in order to wait for Lilly and met the student council duo on our way there, Shizune insisted on accompanying us. Neither I nor Hisao can shake the feeling that Shizune's simply here because she can't bear to postpone the scolding for one more day."

        nvl clear

        n "Hisao and I went to town the other day to do a bit of shopping for this evening. We wanted to make the occasion a bit special and bought tea and snacks just like before to celebrate Lilly's return."
        n "{vspace=30}Lilly's probably not going to have a lot of energy, but I'd be very surprised if that's also the case for her mother. Given her energetic nature, Karla is probably as jetlag-proof as they come."

        nvl hide dissolve

        play sound sfx_car_driveup

        stop music fadeout 3.0

        hide shizu
        hide misha
        hide hisao
        with charaexit

        "While I'm absentmindedly toying with my hair, Hisao suddenly points at a car heading up the parking lot and approaching us. As it gets closer, I see the striking blonde hair of Lilly and her mother behind the windshield."

        stop sound fadeout 1.0

        show lilly cane_weaksmile_cas_ss at twoleft
        show karla basic_smile_cas_ss at tworight
        with charaenter

        "As the car stops in front of us and the car door opens, Karla steps out and gives a cheerful wave while Lilly slowly gets out on the other side."
        ha "Lilly!"

        play music music_comfort fadein 2.0

        hide karla
        show lilly cane_weaksmile_cas_close_ss at center
        with characlose

        "Even though we've spoken with one another on a very frequent basis, I still feel overjoyed to see my best friend again and rush to greet her."

        show lilly basic_overjoyed_cas_close_ss
        with chchange

        "Knowing that Shizune and Misha are watching, I go for a modest embrace, but the moment I make contact with Lilly, she wraps her arms around me and gives me a hug that is as drawn-out and tight as it is sincere and loving."
        li "Hanako..."

        nvl clear
        nvl show dissolve

        n "I blush a bit. I'm not really accustomed to the usually reserved Lilly making such an affectionate and unrestrained gesture. The smile on her face is one of the happiest ones I've ever seen though."
        n "{vspace=60}It dawns on me that Lilly's probably not aware that her cousin is nearby and looking at us, but I decide that that revelation can wait for a few more seconds. With some effort I manage to tune out the rest of the world around me and return Lilly's embrace."
        n "{vspace=30}As fun as the last few weeks have been for me, things still weren't completely the same without Lilly around, and I'm really happy that she's back."

        nvl hide dissolve

        ha "It's... really good to s-see you again, Lilly."
        li "I've really missed having you around, Hanako."

        stop music fadeout 1.0

        show lilly at left
        show karla basic_smile_cas_ss at center
        show shizu adjust_smug_ss at tworight
        show misha hips_grin_ss at right
        with charaenter

        mi "Apparently not enough to come back sooner and avoid missing the first weeks of the new trimester."

        play music music_shizune fadein 4.0

        show lilly cane_emb_cas_close_ss
        show misha hips_laugh_ss
        with chchangefast

        mi "WAHAHAHA~! Awww... that's not nice, Shicchan. You ruined a really sweet moment just there."
        "Upon hearing Misha's voice, Lilly instantly freezes, and a look of horror appears on her face. She lets go of me and hastily turns towards the source of the loud voice that ruined the magic of our greeting."
        "Her face is a little flushed, and I can almost see her brain going into overdrive in an attempt to figure out how to deal with this unexpected embarrassment."
        li "Ah... S-Shizune. When did you get here?"
        "Feeling a bit guilty about not notifying Lilly before, I whisper to her."
        ha "S-Sorry, Lilly. Ummm... We ran into them on our way here, and they f-followed us here."

        show lilly cane_listen_cas_close_ss
        show shizu behind_smile_ss
        show misha hips_smile_ss
        show karla cross_smileclosed_cas_ss
        with chchange

        "Rather than responding to Lilly's question, Shizune turns to Karla, smiles and makes a deep and respectful bow."
        mi "Welcome back to Japan, Aunt Karla. It's good to see you again."
        "Lilly's mother smiles back broadly at Shizune and replies with a polite bow of her own."
        ka "Thank you, Shizune. It is good to see you too. You certainly seem to have grown. I didn't even recognize you at first. How is your family doing these days?"
        mi "About the same as always."
        ka "I see. And who is your friend here?"

        show misha hips_grin_ss
        with chchange

        mi "I'm Misha. Nice to meet you."
        "Maybe I misjudged Shizune. It's probably been a long time since she has last seen her aunt and maybe she simply wanted to say hello to her."
        "From what I've heard, Mister Satou and Shizune's father don't like each other, but as far as I can tell, there appears to be no bad blood between Karla and her niece."

        show misha hips_smile_ss
        show karla basic_smile_cas_ss
        with chchange

        ka "The pleasure is all mine. I am very pleased to meet you as well."
        "She then turns to us."

        show karla basic_cheerful_cas_ss
        with chchange

        ka "Hanako... Hisao. It is very good to see you two again. Lilly told me that you two still managed to make the most out of your remaining vacation days. That is a great relief to me."
        "She bows to us as well, and I notice that her bow towards me is deeper than the others. I can tell that Karla's a lot more formal than she was in Scotland right now. It feels a bit odd coming from her. Is she acting that way because she doesn't want to puzzle her niece?"
        "In the meantime, Lilly has managed to regain her composure and awkwardly nods to Shizune."

        show lilly cane_weaksmile_cas_close_ss
        with chchange

        li "You caught me a bit by surprise, Shizune. But thank you for the welcome nevertheless."

        show karla basic_confused_cas_ss
        with chchange

        "Lilly's mother frowns and shoots a puzzled look at her daughter."
        ka "You were surprised that your own cousin is here to greet you? I was assuming you asked Hanako to bring her along as well."

        show lilly cane_concerned_cas_close_ss
        with chchange

        li "Uh..."
        "A slightly panicked expression appears on Lilly's face, and I suddenly realize that she probably never told her parents that she and Shizune used to get into fights all the time."

        show shizu adjust_evil_ss
        show misha perky_smile_ss
        with chchange

        "From the looks of it, Shizune has come to the same conclusion as she gives Lilly a highly amused “let's see you talk your way out of that one”-look."

        show karla basic_sheepish_cas_ss
        with chchange

        li "I... ah... apologize. I was intending to drop by soon and catch up on the last few weeks. But student council duty must have been keeping you busy, so I wasn't expecting you to be able to take time out of your schedule this evening."

        show misha sign_smile_ss
        with chchange

        mi "Well, it's nice that my efforts and workload are acknowledged every now and then."

        show lilly cane_displeased_cas_close_ss
        with chchange

        "Lilly's mother gives Shizune a curious glance."
        ka "Does student council truly take up so much more time than, say, an ordinary school club?"

        show shizu adjust_smug_ss
        with chchange

        mi "It is hectic at the start and end of each trimester, and it gets even worse during special events like school festivals or other activities. We usually suffer from a lack of helping hands around those times."
        "Shizune toys with her glasses for a second and then starts signing again."
        mi "Not every class representative is of the reliable sort either, and we're regularly forced into crunch time because some of them won't hand in budget reports in time or even worse, ask for extensions of the deadline. This often causes the final few days to be extremely stressful."

        show lilly cane_offended_cas_close_ss
        with chchange

        "I can see the corners of Lilly's mouth twitching a bit as she hears her cousin's remarks. It's obvious that she does not like where this is going, but she doesn't dare react to Shizune in front of her mother."
        "Shizune, on the other hand, appears to be having the time of her life. Karla gives her niece a sympathetic look, obviously still oblivious."

        show karla cross_ponder_cas_ss
        with chchange

        ka "Well, the best thing you can do is to keep fighting the good fight. Think of it as good practice for the workplace later."

        show shizu adjust_happy_ss
        show misha hips_smile_ss
        with chchange

        mi "Yes, I suppose you end up working with all kinds of people there as well."

        show lilly cane_displeased_cas_ss
        show hisao cross_pout_uni_ss at twoleft
        with charadistant

        "I exchange a worried look with my boyfriend who also seems a bit uncomfortable with Shizune's little game. Deciding to cut this awkward little charade short, Hisao steps up to Lilly's mother."
        hi "Maybe it's a good idea to return to the dorm rather than hang around here. I'm sure that Lilly's eager to get back to her room and start unpacking."

        show hisao basic_smile_uni_ss
        show karla basic_smile_cas_ss
        with chchange

        ka "Yes, that's a good idea. Let me get the luggage out of the trunk."
        "Karla opens the trunk of her car and fishes Lilly's suitcase out of it. Before she closes the trunk, however, she quizzically looks at Shizune who's still wearing a huge smile."

        show karla basic_confused_cas_ss
        with chchange

        ka "By the way, Shizune... I remember my daughter is a class representative too. She isn't among those unreliable people you just complained about, is she?"

        show shizu adjust_blush_ss
        show misha perky_smile_ss
        with chchange

        "This time it's Shizune's turn to get a little uneasy. Her opinion of Lilly's handling of her class is pretty well-known, but she obviously doesn't want to appear mean-spirited in front of her aunt."
        "With a little forced smile she shakes her head and signs a few things to Misha, although in a less enthusiastic manner than before."
        mi "Don't worry. Her classmates consider your daughter to be very adept at her duties."

        show misha cross_grin_ss
        with chchange

        mi "Yup. And over the last two weeks several people from her class picked up her duties purely out of loyalty, so that says a lot."

        show lilly cane_cheerful_cas_ss
        show karla cross_smileclosed_cas_ss
        show shizu basic_normal_ss
        with chchange

        "Judging by the lack of signing on Shizune's part preceding it, that last statement is Misha's contribution to the discussion, and my hunch is that Shizune isn't very happy with her friend letting slip that particular detail."
        "Lilly, who was looking rather tense just a minute ago now gives her cousin a cheerful smile before twisting the knife a little bit."
        li "I'm honored by this kind appraisal from no one other than the student council president herself. I shall make sure to remember these gracious words."

        show shizu cross_angry_ss
        hide karla
        with charachangealways

        pause 0.5

        show karla basic_smile_cas_ss
        show shizu behind_frown_ss
        with charachangealways

        "While Lilly's mother has her back turned in order to close the trunk, Shizune shoots her cousin a dirty glare, but when Karla turns around and grabs the suitcase, Shizune merely shakes her head and sighs as if forcing herself to dismiss the matter."
        ka "Let's get going, people."

        scene bg school_dormext_full_ss
        with locationchange

        show lilly cane_smileclosed_cas_ss at left
        show hisao basic_smile_uni_ss at twoleft
        show karla basic_smile_cas_ss at center
        show shizu behind_smile_ss at tworight
        show misha cross_smile_ss at right
        with charaenter

        "We leave the parking lot, walk through the school gate, and make our way to the girls' dorm building."
        "As we near the entrance, Shizune politely bows to Lilly's mother and starts signing to Misha."
        mi "We still have some work left to do, but it was good to see you again."

        show karla basic_smileclosed_cas_ss at center
        with chchange

        "Karla responds with a bow of her own, takes a little card out of her handbag, writes a number on it and then gives it to Shizune."
        ka "I'll be in the area for a little while. If you wish to do some catching up, do not hesitate to send me a little text message, and I'll treat you two to lunch."

        show shizu behind_smile_ss at tworight
        show misha cross_grin_ss at right
        with chchange

        "Shizune gives her aunt a friendly nod, and then she and Misha walk back towards the school building while we venture inside the dormitory."

        scene bg school_girlsdormhall
        show lilly cane_smileclosed_cas at left
        show hisao basic_smile_uni at twoleft
        show karla basic_smile_cas at tworight
        with charaenter

        "When we get to our hallway, I take Lilly's room key (which I got from Lilly before Hisao and I left Scotland) from my bag and unlock the door."

        if _in_replay:
            return    
    
    label .s2:

        $ set_window_tint(TINT_HANAKO)

        play sound sfx_dooropen

        stop music fadeout 2.0

        scene bg school_dormlilly
        show hisao basic_smile_uni at left
        show lilly cane_smileclosed_cas at center
        show karla basic_smile_cas at tworight
        with locationchange

        queue music music_ease fadein 4.0

        ha "Welcome back, Lilly. We cleaned your room for you yesterday. It was already starting to get a little d-dusty in your absence."
        li "Thank you, Hanako. I will be happy to return the favor this week if you let me."
        ha "It's... okay."
        "Lilly's mother takes the opportunity to look around a little bit."

        show karla basic_smileclosed_cas
        with chchange

        ka "Well, isn't this a cozy place?"
        ha "We... umm... bought tea for tonight. I'll go and make some."
        "Lilly smiles at me, but nevertheless shakes her head."

        show lilly cane_smile_cas
        with chchange

        li "Hanako, I think you've already done enough for me as it is. Would you mind if I take over the hosting duties for tonight?"
        ha "Aren't you tired, Lilly?"

        show lilly cane_weaksmile_cas
        with chchange

        li "It's been a rather long day, but I haven't really done much other than sitting still and reading a bit. I think being able to put my shoulder to the wheel for a little while may actually make me feel better."
        ha "Okay then. We put the tea in your cupboard in the kitchen area."

        show lilly cane_satisfied_cas
        with chchange

        li "I will be right back."

        hide lilly
        with charaexit

        show karla:
            ypos 1.1
        show hisao:
            ypos 1.1
        with charamovechangefaster

        "Lilly walks out of the room and the three of us sit down. Lilly's mother stretches herself and sighs, dropping her formal disposition now that we're alone."

        show karla basic_laugh_cas
        with chchange

        ka "Man, at the start of this week I was still in the US. I've really been all over the place lately."
        ha "That must be exhausting."

        show karla cross_ponder_cas
        with chchange

        ka "I've been able to handle it so far. It'll be good to take it easy for a few days though. Take some time to relax and catch up."
        "Lilly's mom plays with her hair a little bit."

        show karla basic_sheepish_cas
        with chchange

        ka "You know, the last time I interacted with Shizune, she was probably short enough to fit in my suitcase with a bit of effort. She's kind of starting to look like her mother now."

        show hisao basic_neutral_uni
        with chchange

        hi "You know Shizune's mother?"

        show karla basic_distant_cas
        with chchange

        "Lilly's mother looks a little wistful for a second."
        ka "When I married my husband, Mayoi was still living at home, so we lived under the same roof for some time until she got married and became part of the Hakamichi family."
        ka "We barely saw each other anymore afterwards as she barely came home anymore after her marriage. Her husband and my husband didn't get along so well, either."

        show hisao basic_speak_uni
        with chchange

        hi "What's Shizune's Dad like then?"

        show karla basic_smug_cas
        with chchange

        "This question makes Karla grin for a moment."
        ka "Pretty much the total opposite of my husband. My husband once told me that he felt his brother-in-law was a cartoon character pretending to be a human. The man's a little odd—or was when I last saw him. That was really long ago though; he might have changed."

        play sound sfx_dooropen

        show karla basic_smile_cas
        show lilly basic_smileclosed_cas
        show hisao basic_smile_uni
        with charaenter

        "Before we can consider whether to leave it at that or ask for more details, the door opens and Lilly comes in carrying a teapot and several cups. She carefully places them on the table, fills the cups, and then hands one to each of us."

        show lilly:
            ypos 1.1
        with charamovefaster

        show lilly basic_giggle_cas
        with chchange

        li "It's been a while since we've spent time together like this. Let's enjoy the evening together."

        show hisao basic_neutral_uni
        with chchange

        "Hisao checks his watch after Lilly says this and frowns."
        hi "I'm afraid I can't stay for very long. I have an appointment in 15 minutes and I still have to stop by my own room."

        show lilly basic_surprised_cas
        with chchange

        li "An appointment?"
        "Lilly looks a little puzzled."

        show lilly basic_displeased_cas
        with chchange

        li "Isn't it a little late for that? Most of the teachers have probably gone home already."
        "I giggle."
        ha "Not this t-teacher."

        show lilly basic_surprised_cas
        with chchange

        li "I beg your pardon?"

        show hisao cross_grin_uni
        with chchange

        hi "It's a bit of a long story, but the gist of it is that Mutou was approached by several students who were interested in giving the science club a try. There are now two first years and one second year student attending the meetings."
        hi "One of the juniors still has some trouble with some of the subjects, and I didn't have a lot of time to explain them to him during our last meeting, so I promised to stop by his room this evening to tutor him a bit more."

        show lilly basic_weaksmile_cas
        with chchange

        li "If he has trouble with the subject then isn't he in the wrong club?"

        show hisao basic_smile_uni
        show karla basic_sheepish_cas
        with chchange

        ka "I recall that that article Hanako wrote specifically said that an interest in the subject was more important than good marks. Looks like some people took that literally."
        ha "It was actually... m-meant to be taken that way."

        show karla basic_confused_cas
        with chchange

        ka "Hmmm?"
        ha "I... had some trouble with a few parts myself just before the summer break, but Hisao was r-really good at explaining them. So I thought..."

        show lilly basic_smileclosed_cas
        show hisao basic_grin_uni
        with chchange

        hi "That line in Hanako's article about interest in the subject being more important than high marks is more or less a nice way of saying that the club is ideal for people who have an interest in science, but have trouble following Mutou's lectures. His teaching style is... a bit unique."
        hi "At the science club, we can let members get familiar with certain topics in a more casual manner that allows them to understand the subject better. And there are also other members who can help explain things."

        show karla cross_wut_cas
        with chchange

        ka "If students are having trouble comprehending a subject because a teacher's lectures are too convoluted, starting a club to compensate for that isn't really the first thing I would do as a school."

        show lilly basic_giggle_cas
        with chchange

        li "That may be so, but Mutou has his good qualities as well and most students like him. Also, I think this is a really good initiative. I hope word of mouth can get you a few more members in the future, Hisao."

        show karla basic_smile_cas
        show lilly basic_smile_cas
        show hisao basic_smile_uni
        with chchange

        hi "Thanks Lilly. Anyway, I guess I'd better get going. I still need to get my textbooks from my room."

        show karla basic_sheepish_cas
        with chchange

        ka "I very much doubt that we won't be seeing each other again before I fly back to the UK, so I'm not going to say goodbye here and now. Best of luck with your tutoring gig."
        hi "Thanks. Have fun and enjoy the snacks we bought."

        show hisao:
            ypos 1.0
        show karla behind hisao
        show lilly behind hisao
        with charamovefaster

        show hisao at offscreenright
        with charamovefast

        hide hisao
        with None

        "He gives me a quick kiss, gets up, and walks out of Lilly's room, leaving me with the two Satous."

        show lilly basic_smileclosed_cas
        show karla basic_smileclosed_cas
        with chchange

        "With not much more to say about the subject of Hisao's new responsibilities, we simply sit there for a little while and take the occasional sip from our tea cups."
        "Eventually the silence becomes a little awkward, and I bring up the first subject that pops up in my mind."
        ha "So ummm... Mrs. Satou..."

        show karla basic_laugh_cas
        with chchange

        ka "I won't be offended if you keep using my first name, Miss Ikezawa. But I won't press the matter if you feel rude doing so."
        ha "Ummm... Karla... How d-did it go in America?"

        show karla basic_cheerful_cas
        with chchange

        ka "I suspect you already know most of it, seeing that Lilly's been calling you so often, but... I'd say the trip was officially a success."
        ha "Officially?"

        stop music fadeout 2.0

        queue music music_night fadein 4.0

        show lilly basic_displeased_cas
        show karla basic_speak_cas
        with chchange

        ka "Well, before my husband was hospitalized, I was looking forward to the trip. Not just because we'd finally be tying up a process that's been taking us years to set up, but also because I was planning to stick a well-earned vacation at the end of it."

        show karla cross_ponder_cas
        with chchange

        ka "Obviously that didn't end up happening, and during most of the trip I was actively counting down the minutes. So I can't really say it was an enjoyable experience. But since we ended up striking a major deal there, I can at least call it a productive trip."
        ha "You could... still go on v-vacation with him when he's feeling a little better."

        show lilly basic_weaksmile_cas
        show karla basic_sheepishclosed_cas
        with chchange

        "Lilly's mother smiles at my suggestion, but I notice her smile has a sad quality to it. Did I say anything wrong?"
        ka "Yeah, I guess I could try and convince him to take a break together... When he's feeling better."
        "I notice Lilly has adopted the same sad smile as her mother. They obviously know something I don't. Last time I spoke to Lilly on the phone she said that his condition was slowly improving."
        ha "Ummm... Is he... s-still okay?"

        show lilly basic_concerned_cas
        show karla basic_worried_cas
        with chchange

        "Karla looks away and for a moment there's a very bitter look in her eyes that sends a shiver down my spine. It's the same kind of look that I've seen on Akira's face a few times."
        ka "Hmmm... Physically he's getting better, but about a day after we got back, we got word that he won't be returning to his job after all this. It was a pretty severe blow to his morale even though I got the impression he wasn't very surprised himself."
        ha "He g-got fired?"

        show karla cross_displeased_cas
        with chchange

        ka "Well, technically he resigned on his own, but... It's a bit of a complicated situation. Let's just say corporate politics reared their ugly head and leave it at that."
        ha "I'm s-sorry..."

        "Karla doesn't immediately answer and closes her eyes."

        show lilly basic_sad_cas
        show karla cross_ponder_cas
        with chchange

        ka "You know... My mother used to tell me that God works in mysterious ways. When we asked Lilly and Akira to join us in Scotland, the idea was to make a fresh new start. Things worked out differently than we planned them, but..."

        show lilly basic_weaksmile_cas
        show karla basic_sheepish_cas
        with chchange

        "She opens her eyes and smirks."
        ka "This has all the telltale marks of an opportunity to make that fresh new start. It just feels a bit mixed. I can't really feel glad about it knowing what had to happen for things to get to this point."
        "This gets me to smile. I've been thinking the same on several occasions ever since I became Hisao's girlfriend."
        ha "I... think that's f-fine. I've often thought about this m-myself. If Hisao... never had his first h-heart attack, he never would have c-come here."
        ha "I wouldn't w-wish what he's been through on anyone, but... I think that... maybe... it's still... okay for me... to feel really happy that he came here and... that I met him."

        show lilly basic_giggle_cas
        show karla basic_laugh_cas
        with chchange

        "Both Lilly and her mother laugh cheerfully at my reply."

        ka "You know, that's a pretty good point. I guess there's not necessarily something wrong about being happy with silver linings. Now we'll just have to figure where to go from here."

        show lilly basic_smileclosed_cas
        show karla basic_sheepish_cas
        with chchange

        ha "Any ideas?"
        "Lilly smiles mysteriously."
